<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Wave Weekly Rental Price in Hanoi: Cost Planning Guide</h1>
<p>The Honda Wave rents at a verified 700,000 VND per week in Hanoi, which works out to 100,000 VND per day for the country's most trusted workhorse. This guide plans the weekly rental honestly: what the weekly rate buys, when a week is the right length, how it beats the daily rate, and when the monthly rate takes over.</p>
<p>We cover the verified price, the per-day arithmetic that makes the week attractive, planning a seven-day riding budget, the crossover points against the 150,000 VND daily rate and the 900,000 to 1,200,000 VND monthly rate, and the practical questions that make a weekly rental run cleanly. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
